   {
    "assignment_group": "Endpoint Management",
    "category": "software",
    "description": "Our compliance audit flagged a batch of managed laptops as non-compliant in Intune. When the 'Require compliant device' Conditional Access policy moves to hard enforcement on 2026-07-20, those users will be blocked from corporate apps (Outlook, Teams, SharePoint). This appears to stem from the Finance device ring after last week's Intune baseline policy push (change CHG0044180). Please investigate across Intune, Defender and Entra, work out which managed devices are genuinely non-compliant, bring each of them back to compliant before the enforcement date, and close this incident when the fleet is clean. Do not disrupt devices that are fine or that have an approved exemption.",
    "number": "INC0044201",
    "priority": "1",
